# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output.
#
# The two packages that are consumed as BUILT artifacts (`astro-loader-github-releases`
# and `astro-mail-obfuscation`) commit their `dist/` on purpose: their consumer —
# the FunctionFly docs site — installs them as `file:` dependencies and nothing in
# that workspace builds them, so a checkout without `dist/` cannot build the site.
# `bun run verify:dist` in CI fails the build when the committed output drifts from
# the source, so the artefact cannot go stale silently.
#
# The three source-consumed packages (`starlight-announcement`, `starlight-mega-menu`,
# `starlight-site-graph`) ship TypeScript/Astro sources and have no build step.

